-- LEARN_SPELL wrapper - so every recipe needs a pair. Cloned from 2754 (a real trainer
-- wrapper), never from a `Plans:` spell, which targets the caster and makes the NPC teach
-- itself. See sql/03 and docs/SPELL-IDS.md.
